Third-party material included in this repository:

- firmware/main/font5x7.h: 5x7 bitmap font from the Adafruit GFX Library,
  Copyright (c) 2012 Adafruit Industries, BSD license.
- firmware/main/tof.c: register configuration and sequence derived from the
  STMicroelectronics VL53L1X Ultra Lite Driver, Copyright (c) 2018
  STMicroelectronics, BSD-3-Clause.
- enclosure/keycaps/*.3mf: the arrow, terminal and folder legends are outlines
  of Lucide icons (https://lucide.dev), ISC license.
- hardware/: symbols and footprints from the official KiCad libraries,
  CC-BY-SA 4.0 with the KiCad library exception.
